# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRIVATE ASSETS — kept locally, NOT committed to git
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These image files contain personal data (NIK, customer names, customer faces
# without published consent). They are referenced in the codebase for layout
# completeness but are never RENDERED on the live site (the legalitas page
# uses canShowScan() helper to hide them, hampers page only uses safe-named
# files, teras page only uses storefront + founder portrait).
#
# To work with these locally for development, keep them in public/image/.
# They will not be pushed to GitHub or deployed to Vercel.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

